-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신 청&gt;</span></span></v:textbox></v:rect></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><v:rect style=\"HEIGHT: 17.4pt; WIDTH: 46.68pt; v-text-anchor: middle\" strokeweight=\"1.42pt\" fillcolor=\"#b3c5f3\"><v:textbox><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></v:textbox></v:rect><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ｏ</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">주소지 기준으로 주소가 대구</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><u>·</u></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">경북인 경우에 대구에서 검사받는 것이 원칙이지만 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">경북 소재 학교를 다닐 경우에도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -1